rdia<\/td><\/tr><tr><td height=\"20\">Information Sound<\/td><td>Probe Disconnection, Printer door open, No Paper, Low Battery<\/td><td>Probe Disconnection, Printer door open, No Paper, Low Battery<\/td><\/tr><tr><td height=\"20\">Printer Speed<\/td><td>1,2,3,cm\/minute, 10cm\/min. (Trend mode only)<\/td><td>1,2,3,cm\/minute, 10cm\/min. (Trend mode only)<\/td><\/tr><tr><td height=\"20\">Thermal Paper (Z-fold)<\/td><td>150mm (W) x 13.5m (L)<\/td><td>150mm (W) x 13.5m (L)<\/td><\/tr><tr><td height=\"20\">Auto Print<\/td><td>10, 20, 30, 40, 50, 60 minute<\/td><td>10, 20, 30, 40, 50, 60 minute<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-ed76c8a\" data-id=\"ed76c8a\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d7a3ee0 flex-horizontal-align-default flex-horizontal-align-tablet-default flex-horizontal-align-mobile-default flex-vertical-align-default flex-vertical-align-tablet-default flex-vertical-align-mobile-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"d7a3ee0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Fetal Monitor (BT-350)<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9463f33 flex-horizontal-align-default flex-horizontal-align-tablet-default flex-horizontal-align-mobile-default flex-vertical-align-default flex-vertical-align-tablet-default flex-vertical-align-mobile-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9463f33\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-text-editor elementor-clearfix\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Description<\/h4><p><strong>Advanced Fetal Monitor dedicated to Fetal health monitoring.<\/strong><\/p><p><strong>BT-350 LCD<\/strong><\/p><ul><li><strong>BT-350 LCD :<\/strong> Display trace and numbers. Stored data can be reviewed afterward.<\/li><li><strong>CTG Analysis :<\/strong> Calculates important data such as baseline, Acceleration, Deceleration, Fetal movement.<\/li><li><strong>Cross Channel Verification :<\/strong> Prevent the FHR miscalculated by twin fetus by alarm.<\/li><li><strong>Multi Language Support :<\/strong> 13 languages including English, Chinese, Spanish, German, Russia, Portuguese and more languages are available.<\/li><li><strong>Built-in Quick Guide :<\/strong> Quick guide in the menu screen helps the user get to understand how to use and maintain the monitor properly.<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6c85e3f flex-horizontal-align-default flex-horizontal-align-tablet-default flex-horizontal-align-mobile-default flex-vertical-align-default flex-vertical-align-tablet-default flex-vertical-align-mobile-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6c85e3f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-text-editor elementor-clearfix\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>BT-350 LED<\/strong><\/p><ul><li><strong>BT-350 LED :<\/strong> Display numbers only. Large and bright LED is visible from a distance.<\/li><li><strong>Various Paper Selection :<\/strong> BT-350 can use two most usual papers in the market (30-240bpm \/ 50-210bpm).<\/li><li><strong>USB Data Save :<\/strong> FHR and UC trend data can be exported to USB memory stick and it can be managed by BCM-350 Central Monitoring Software.<\/li><li><strong>Central Monitoring Software :<\/strong> Works on BCM-350 software along with other Fetal monitors by wire or wireless.<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9977450 flex-horizontal-align-default flex-horizontal-align-tablet-default flex-horizontal-align-mobile-default flex-vertical-align-default flex-vertical-align-tablet-default flex-vertical-align-mobile-default elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9977450\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-text-editor elementor-clearfix\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Options<\/strong><\/p><ul><li><strong>Connection :<\/strong><\/li><li>Maximum connection : 16 monitors.<\/li><li>Wire connection : RS-232C, Lan.<\/li><li>Wireless connection : Bluetooth (optional)<\/li><li><strong>Remote Control :<\/strong> BCM-350 is not only monitoring Fetal Monitors at central station but it can control monitors remote for basic function.<\/li><li><strong>Database :<\/strong> BCM-350 is store data from the BT-300\/350 by network connection and by USB memory. Stored data in internal memory of BT-350 can be exported to USB memory and t can be managed by BCM-350.<\/li><li><strong>Multi Language Support :<\/strong> BCM-350 is multi-lingual software and friendly to many non-English speaking users.<\/li><li><strong>Various Bed Display mode :<\/strong> Various style of display can satisfy every users with their own preference.<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a7e9c79 flex-horizontal-align-default flex-horizontal-align-tablet-default flex-horizontal-align-mobile-default flex-vertical-align-default flex-vertical-align-tablet-default flex-vertical-align-mobile-default elementor-